e interacting with the environment and inventory. Dialogue is fully voiced, and occasional dialogue choices can shift the story and its ending slightly. The game deals with mature themes including depression, suicide, murder, and illness, alongside moments of humor.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-cat-lady", "videos": [{"id": 5402, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Wx6j2I8v2Z0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wx6j2I8v2Z0", "title": "The Cat Lady - Release Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Wx6j2I8v2Z0/sddefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 8574, "name": "Devil Came Through Here"}], "characters": [{"id": 14015, "name": "Queen of Maggots"}, {"id": 11135, "name": "Ann"}, {"id": 15289, "name": "The Cat Lady"}, {"id": 15299, "name": "Rita Tickle"}, {"id": 15291, "name": "Doctor X / Eric Ashworth"}, {"id": 15292, "name": "Pest Control Man / Galdys, his wife"}, {"id": 15301, "name": "Adam's Father / Doctor"}, {"id": 15290, "name": "Mitzi"}, {"id": 15294, "name": "Liz"}, {"id": 15302, "name": "Tied Up Girl"}, {"id": 15297, "name": "Hangman"}, {"id": 12820, "name": "Pauline"}, {"id": 15300, "name": "Security Guy"}, {"id": 1769, "name": "Jesse"}, {"id": 15295, "name": "Bryan"}, {"id": 15296, "name": "The Dog Lady"}, {"id": 15303, "name": "Police Phone Operator"}, {"id": 15304, "name": "Crow / Joe's Dead Wife"}, {"id": 15298, "name": "Lover"}, {"id": 15293, "name": "Joe Davis"}, {"id": 2569, "name": "Nurse"}]}